{{#> layout title=title page=page}}{{#*inline "content"}}
{{#> components/page-header title=title subtitle="How every closed session is scored: four criteria, the model that judges each, and the exact instructions it receives. Scores appear on each session and roll up into Impact."}}
{{#*inline "header_actions"}}{{#if can_trigger}}<form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/evaluation/queue" class="sp-inventory-inline"><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--outline" type="submit" title="Queue every session that has closed within the lookback window and is not yet scored">Queue closed sessions</button></form> <form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/evaluation/run" class="sp-inventory-inline"><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--outline" type="submit" title="Judge the next batch of queued rows now and show the runs"{{#unless summary.queued}} disabled{{/unless}}>Run pending now ({{summary.queued}})</button></form> {{/if}}<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--primary" href="{{runs_url}}">Judge runs &rarr;</a>{{/inline}}
{{/components/page-header}}
{{> analysis-subnav}}
{{#if configured}}
{{#unless enabled}}
{{> components/notice tone="warn" title="Scoring is off" message="services/evaluation/config.yaml is present but scoring is not running: either it sets enabled: false or no enabled plugin sets hooks.evaluation: true."}}
{{/unless}}
<p class="sp-eval-mode">{{#if automatic}}{{> components/badge tone="ok" text="Automatic"}} Closed sessions are queued by the scheduler (<code>evaluation.automatic: true</code> in the profile); the buttons run the same engine on demand.{{else}}{{> components/badge tone="info" text="Manual"}} Sessions are scored only from the buttons — here, on a session page, or in the Conversations list. Set <code>evaluation.automatic: true</code> in the profile to score every closed session without a click.{{/if}}{{#unless inference_available}} {{> components/badge tone="warn" text="No judge"}} This instance carries no inference client, so nothing can score until a provider is configured.{{/unless}}</p>
<div class="sp-kpi-grid sp-kpi-grid--compact">
{{> components/kpi label="Judge runs" value=summary.runs note=(concat summary.failed " failed · " summary.queued " queued")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Judge spend" value=judge_spend note=(concat "last " summary_days " days, excluded from user figures")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Intent" value=intent_avg note=(concat "mean over " summary.intent.sessions " sessions")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Quality" value=quality_avg note=(concat "mean over " summary.quality.sessions " sessions")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Speed" value=speed_avg note=(concat "mean over " summary.speed.sessions " sessions")}}
{{> components/kpi label="Cost" value=cost_avg note=(concat "mean over " summary.cost.sessions " sessions")}}
</div>
<details class="sp-analysis-definitions"><summary>When a session is scored</summary>
<p>A session closes on <code>SessionEnd</code> from its host. Hosts whose adapter has no end-of-session event close after {{quiet_minutes}} minutes of silence. Sessions with fewer than {{min_user_prompts}} user prompt(s) or older than {{lookback_hours}} hours are never queued. {{#if automatic}}The <code>session_evaluation</code> job runs every minute: it queues what closed, then{{else}}Nothing is queued on its own; <em>Queue closed sessions</em> queues what closed, <em>Evaluate now</em> on a session queues that one, and the <code>session_evaluation</code> job (every minute) or <em>Run pending now</em>{{/if}} leases one (session, criterion) pair at a time and records a run whatever the outcome; a failed run is retried with backoff and then left visible. A click runs the judge inline and answers when its runs are recorded, marked <code>manual</code> with the admin who asked. Judge calls go through the gateway as the job actor and never count against the person judged or the person who clicked.{{#if owner_plugin}} Owner plugin: <code>{{owner_plugin}}</code>.{{/if}} Configuration hash <code>{{config_hash_short}}</code> is stamped on every run.</p>
</details>
{{#each criteria}}
<section class="sp-section sp-eval-criterion" id="criterion-{{name}}">
{{> components/section title=name note=(concat scoring " · " provider " / " model " · " max_output_tokens " output tokens")}}
<div class="sp-eval-criterion__facts">
<div><span class="sp-eval-criterion__label">Inputs</span><span class="sp-eval-criterion__values">{{#each inputs}}{{> components/badge tone="muted" text=this}}{{/each}}</span></div>
{{#if is_metric}}<div><span class="sp-eval-criterion__label">Thresholds</span><span class="sp-eval-criterion__values">{{#each thresholds}}{{> components/badge tone="info" text=(concat label ": " value)}}{{/each}}</span></div>{{/if}}
<div><span class="sp-eval-criterion__label">Instructions file</span><code>{{instructions_path}}</code></div>
</div>
<details class="sp-eval-criterion__prompt" open><summary>System prompt as the judge receives it</summary><pre class="sp-analysis-file-preview"><code>{{system_prompt}}</code></pre></details>
<details class="sp-eval-criterion__prompt"><summary>Required output schema</summary><pre class="sp-analysis-file-preview"><code>{{schema_json}}</code></pre></details>
</section>
{{/each}}
{{else}}
{{> components/empty-state title="Evaluation is not configured" message="Add services/evaluation/config.yaml with four criteria and set hooks.evaluation: true on the governance-owning plugin. The boot validates the file against the provider catalog."}}
{{/if}}
{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
